                <pb facs="0435" n="319" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg319"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Subinclosure.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Joint Resolution of the General Assembly of
                        Virginia.</hi>
                </head>
                <p>Whereas, unbroken peace and good will has existed between the United States and
                    Great Britain for more than a century, and the people of Virginia entertain the
                    warmest friendship for the people of their mother country—</p>
                <p>Now therefore, as a token of esteem and good will.</p>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Be it resolved by the House of Delegates of Virginia,
                        the Senate concurring</hi>, That a replica of the Houdon statue of George
                    Washington be presented to the United Kingdom of Great Britain and Ireland.</p>
            </div>
